{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "TARS Admin Frontend APIs - 文件管理",
    "description": "文件分片上传、单文件上传、上传完成通知和文件描述查询。\n\n此文件用于按模块导入 Apifox。变量不写入模块集合，请先导入 api-docs/apifox-shared-environment.postman_environment.json，或在 Apifox 项目/环境变量中维护同名变量。\n接口依赖变量会通过前置/后置脚本写入环境变量和全局变量，不会写入模块变量。",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "tags": [],
  "paths": {
    "/gatewayUrl": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "查询文件描述 [command=11004]",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "接口名称：searchFileDescription\n接口描述：按 fileKeys 查询文件下载和分片描述。\n分组：文件管理\n网关分发指令：command=11004 (CommandId.SearchFileDescription)\n代码来源：src/api/file/index.ts\nReq:\n{\n  \"fileKeys\": [\n    \"{{fileKey}}\"\n  ]\n}\nRes:\n{\n  \"code\": 0,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"files\": []\n  },\n  \"message\": \"success\"\n}",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "JSON 请求体",
            "required": true,
            "example": "application/json",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "command",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "网关分发指令，CommandId.SearchFileDescription = 11004",
            "required": true,
            "example": "11004",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "fileKeys": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "fileKeys"
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "fileKeys": [
                  "{{fileKey}}"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {}
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    },
    "/baseUrl/upload_part": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "上传分片",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "接口名称：uploadFileChunk\n接口描述：后端中转上传单个分片，multipart/form-data。\n分组：文件管理\n代码来源：src/api/file/index.ts\nReq:\n{\n  \"partID\": 1,\n  \"content\": \"<File>\",\n  \"fileKey\": \"{{fileKey}}\"\n}\nRes:\n{\n  \"code\": 0,\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"message\": \"success\"\n}",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "由 FormData 生成",
            "required": true,
            "example": "multipart/form-data",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "partID": {
                    "example": "1",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "content": {
                    "example": "<File>",
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "binary"
                  },
                  "fileKey": {
                    "example": "{{fileKey}}",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "partID",
                  "content",
                  "fileKey"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {}
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    },
    "/baseUrl/upload": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "上传单文件",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "接口名称：uploadSingleFile\n接口描述：使用 multipart/form-data 上传单个文件。\n分组：文件管理\n代码来源：src/api/file/index.ts\nReq:\n{\n  \"fileName\": \"thumbnail.png\",\n  \"fileSize\": 1024,\n  \"entryPoint\": 2,\n  \"md5\": \"md5\",\n  \"file\": \"<File>\"\n}\nRes:\n{\n  \"code\": 0,\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"message\": \"success\"\n}",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "由 FormData 生成",
            "required": true,
            "example": "multipart/form-data",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "fileName": {
                    "example": "thumbnail.png",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "fileSize": {
                    "example": "1024",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "entryPoint": {
                    "example": "2",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "md5": {
                    "example": "md5",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "file": {
                    "example": "<File>",
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "binary"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "fileName",
                  "fileSize",
                  "entryPoint",
                  "md5",
                  "file"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {}
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {},
    "responses": {},
    "securitySchemes": {}
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "",
      "description": "开发环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": []
}